<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') %>

<section class="about-hero">
  <div class="about-hero-inner">
    <h1>About StayZly</h1>
    <p class="about-sub">We're on a mission to make travel accessible, affordable, and unforgettable for everyone.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-stats">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">500K+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Stays</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">190+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Countries</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">10M+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Happy Guests</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">4.8</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Average Rating</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-story">
  <div class="container about-story-grid">
    <div class="story-text">
      <h4>Our Story</h4>
      <p>The travel industry has rapidly embraced digital platforms, making it easier for travellers to discover, compare, and book accommodations. However, most existing platforms only provide listing and reservation services. They lack personalized trip planning, immersive previews, and robust verification systems that ensure both safety and transparency.</p>

      <p>StayZly is designed to bridge this gap. It is a comprehensive travel booking platform that integrates: • AI-powered itinerary generation • Host and property verification with direct contact options • Secure booking workflows • Google Maps for location awareness, and • Exploratory AR/VR previews for immersive travel planning.</p>

      
    </div>

    <div class="story-image">
      <img src="/images/office.jpg.jpg" alt="Our team meeting">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-values">
  <div class="container values-header">
    <h3>Our Values</h3>
    <p>These principles guide everything we do at StayZly</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container values-grid">
    <div class="value-card">
      <div class="value-icon">🔒</div>
      <h4>Trust & Safety</h4>
      <p>We verify every host and property to ensure your safety and peace of mind.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <div class="value-icon">❤️</div>
      <h4>Community First</h4>
      <p>Building meaningful connections between travelers and hosts worldwide.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <div class="value-icon">🌐</div>
      <h4>Global Reach</h4>
      <p>Access to unique stays in over 190 countries across the globe.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <div class="value-icon">🏅</div>
      <h4>Quality Standards</h4>
      <p>Maintaining the highest standards for every property on our platform.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
